      "category": "ai",
      "title": "How Claude marks AI-generated content",
      "url": "https://support.claude.com/en/articles/16266773-how-claude-marks-ai-generated-content",
      "discuss_url": "https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=49250109",
      "score": 247,
      "comments": 208,
      "author": "mfiguiere",
      "published": "2026-08-10T21:36:56Z",
      "bullets": [
        "Anthropic embeds subtle statistical watermarks into Claude's token sampling probabilities during text generation for automated provenance tracking.",
        "The watermark algorithm modifies logit distributions, allowing accurate detection of Claude outputs without storing response logs or metadata.",
        "This decoding-level marking preserves generation latency and semantic quality while resisting common light editing and paraphrasing attacks."
      ]
    },
