      "bullets": [
        "Docker Sandboxes deliver disposable, isolated runtime environments designed specifically to execute untrusted LLM-generated code and autonomous agent actions safely.",
        "Prevents host contamination and security breaches by enforcing ephemeral lifecycles, strict resource isolation, and automatic environment destruction post-execution.",
        "Integrates directly into existing DevOps workflows using standard Docker APIs to seamlessly manage secure, dynamic code execution for AI applications."
      ]
